        "title": "Where is Cosine Negative?",
        "text": "Using CAST:\n- Quadrant 2: 180° - ref angle = 180° - 30° = 150°\n- Quadrant 3: 180° + ref angle = 180° + 30° = 210°\n\nSo 2x = 150° or 2x = 210° (plus multiples of 360°)",
